WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.088
An air bubble opens a fluid-lined channel. Its

00:00:04.088 --> 00:00:07.270
advancing boundary reaches the epithelial layer before

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:09.089
the space has cleared.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:18.086
A parallel-plate chamber isolates this moving boundary.

00:00:18.086 --> 00:00:21.723
It reproduces one mechanical event, without reproducing

00:00:21.723 --> 00:00:23.281
an entire lung.

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:33.791
Our 2021 experiment exposed cultured rat L2 epithelial

00:00:33.791 --> 00:00:38.675
cells to a single advancing bubble in that chamber.

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:46.945
We compared static cultures with bubble-exposed cells,

00:00:46.945 --> 00:00:50.798
including cells pretreated with dexamethasone or

00:00:50.798 --> 00:00:51.441
transdehydroandrosterone.

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:57.942
Live–dead fluorescence staining measured injury. Actin

00:00:57.942 --> 00:01:02.016
staining and atomic force microscopy examined cellular

00:01:02.016 --> 00:01:03.762
structure and mechanics.

00:01:06.450 --> 00:01:10.748
In the untreated bubble-exposed group, mean cell death

00:01:10.748 --> 00:01:15.045
reached 54.7 percent. The test involved cultured cells.

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:22.418
Dexamethasone pretreatment reduced mean cell death to

00:01:22.418 --> 00:01:26.386
15.1 percent under the same experimental exposure.

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:33.779
With transdehydroandrosterone pretreatment, mean cell

00:01:33.779 --> 00:01:38.440
death was 16.1 percent. Neither measurement represents

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:39.772
clinical efficacy.

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:46.407
Latrunculin A, a cytoskeletal comparator, yielded 20.9

00:01:46.407 --> 00:01:50.365
percent mean cell death after bubble exposure.

00:01:53.450 --> 00:01:57.761
We examined actin organization and cellular mechanics

00:01:57.761 --> 00:02:01.456
alongside viability. Their relationship still needs

00:02:01.456 --> 00:02:03.304
further mechanistic investigation.

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:09.183
The chamber supplied controlled evidence about a

00:02:09.183 --> 00:02:12.383
physical injury. Prevention in ventilated patients

00:02:12.383 --> 00:02:15.049
remains untested by this experiment.
